(9) Have the power to adjust, settle, compromise or submit to arbitration, any action, causes of action, accounts, debts, claims, demands, disputes and matters in favor of or against the city or in which the city is concerned as debtor or creditor, now existing or which may hereafter arise, and may resolve same by the specific approval of the mayor or council;
(10) Keep complete and accurate records of the following, which records shall forever remain the property of the city:
